      "content": "ok thanks. i'm just really worried about the baby so i don't want to take too much. if i take two of the 200mg pills at once (so 400mg total) does that make it way more dangerous or is that still within a safe range for the first trimester? i just really need to know if i can just take it and sleep now.",
